## Investment Thesis

AI2AI is building the verification layer for AI-assisted software development. As LLMs generate more code, the need for formal guarantees grows proportionally. AI2AI's neurosymbolic approach — LLMs propose, symbolic engines prove — addresses this directly.

The company operates an open-core model comparable to GitLab's early trajectory: a widely-adopted open-source tool ([[fact:ai2ai_facts.github-stars]] GitHub stars, [[fact:ai2ai_facts.contributors]] contributors) that converts into enterprise revenue. With [[fact:ai2ai_facts.teams-using]] teams already integrated into CI/CD pipelines, the distribution moat is real.

